      <title>Aggressive power management in graphics hardware</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>X.org</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Computers spend a lot of time idle, and graphics cards spend a lot of time just displaying a static image. This talk presents various techniques for reducing the power consumption of graphics hardware without any significant impact on visual quality or performance.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  </abstract>
      <description></description>
      <persons>
          <person id="2951">Matthew Garrett</person>
